    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just not just one day though. it’s every day. it’s every single thing. i try to play by the rules, i do what they say, but the rules change every time i get close. it feels like i'm fighting a ghost. i'm so tired of fighting something that doesn't even acknowledge i'm here. how am i supposed to keep going when there's nothing to hold onto?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
